46:["$","p",null,{"children":["Reconnect is a ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"flat 0.5-second retry: no backoff, no jitter, no cap, and no\nconfiguration field"}],". That cadence is the signature, and a scheduler outage\nproduces it from every worker simultaneously for the duration."]}]
