4d:["$","p",null,{"children":["The FD limit deserves special attention. Forge uses only ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"80% of the\nlimit it actually achieved"}],", not 80% of what you configured. In a container\nwith a hard ",["$","code",null,{"children":"nofile"}]," cap, the semaphore silently shrinks and the only evidence\nis a startup warning:"]}]
